  "bodyHash": "6d9ef19ba1a701f3",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Hopper Gadgetry 增添了聰明的新物品移動方式——搭配篩選器、管道與木製科技魔法。該是升級你的物品運輸系統的時候了——而且超省錢！不需要博士學位也能懂。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⛓️ 格柵漏斗</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">像漏斗，但聰明多了！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">最多可使用 5 個格子來過濾輸入的物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">沒有過濾？沒問題——它會像普通漏斗一樣運作。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">頂部還裝飾著時尚的鐵欄杆——兼具實用與美觀。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 導管</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">這是專為你的物品設計的木製管道！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">會將物品送入相連的容器，但不會從中抽取。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">不會撿起地面上的掉落物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可串聯連接，並支援任何方向運作，甚至向上！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👇 溜槽</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">一款完全由木頭製成的基礎版漏斗變體！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">僅能撿拾地面上的物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">不儲存任何物品——會將物品直接向下傳遞至容器。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">方向？只有向下。它就只知道這個。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🚂 漏斗礦車</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">格柵漏斗礦車</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：擁有格柵漏斗的所有過濾功能，現在可以裝上輪子行駛。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">溜槽礦車</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：邊滾動邊將撿起的物品直接傳輸至下方的容器。非常適合負責清理工作！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器皆需安裝此模組</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（在 Fabric 端需要安裝由 Prospector 開發的 Mod Menu）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，還需安裝 Forge Config Screens。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 資料夾內，檔名分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具體取決於設定類型。並非所有類型的設定檔都會存在，視模組而定。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝才華洋溢的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mim1q\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mim1q</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 創作了所有精美的材質貼圖。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fyberoptic\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FyberOptic</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hopper-ducts\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Hopper Ducts</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組啟發了本專案。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sargunv\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Sargunv</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/composable-automation\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Composable Automation</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組啟發了本專案。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/leaves-be-gone\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchanting-infuser\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
